- T1.3 Generation counter and invalidation bump sites {{T1.3}}
- T1.4 Forwarded mark in ip_forward() and ip_output() {{T1.4}}
- T1.5 vlan helpers: vlan_flow_info() and vlan_flow_lookup() {{T1.5}}
