**As** the router owner, **I want** routed IPv4 unicast between the cnmac ports and VLANs to be forwarded on a hit without softnet, `ip_input`, `ip_forward` or a route lookup, **so that** one forwarded flow no longer saturates a core and forwarding approaches line rate.

### Requirement (SPEC §5, Must, verbatim)

> **R1** — Forward IPv4 unicast between cnmac ports and VLANs without softnet, `ip_input`, `ip_forward` or a route lookup on the hit path.

### Acceptance

- [ ] Verified by T2.6 Correctness and VLAN suites (mode 1) {{T2.6}}
- [ ] Verified by T2.10 Measure mode 1 against G0 (R13), proves G3 {{T2.10}}

