**As** the router owner, **I want** hits to require both physical ports running with link, and commits to require both logical interfaces and their parents up and running with usable links, **so that** no offloaded traffic crosses a down link or a disabled VLAN.

### Requirement (SPEC §5, Must, verbatim)

> **R10** — The hit path checks `IFF_RUNNING` and link on both physical ports. Commit requires both logical interfaces and parents to be up/running with usable links; logical-state changes invalidate before new admissions may rely on the old state.

